    "text": "PRODUCT ENGINEER · TECHNICAL PROJECT MANAGER\n\nHi, I'm Lorenzo.\nI build products, organize complex projects, and teach what I learn.\n\nI studied management engineering and learned software because I wanted to turn ideas into real things. Today I work across product, technology and applied AI.\n\nI am at my best when a problem is still unclear: I give it structure, build a first working version, and keep the reasoning behind decisions clear as the work grows. \n\nI have always loved solving problems and building things. It comes naturally to me, and I genuinely enjoy it.",
